This repository stores no model weights. A locally built Docker image contains
the following models, converted by Katsuya Hyodo (PINTO_model_zoo):
- DEIMv2-Wholebody49, Apache-2.0:
  https://github.com/PINTO0309/PINTO_model_zoo/tree/main/488_DEIMv2-Wholebody49
- OSNet-AIN x1.0 unified_aug (person ReID, from 502_PersonViT), Apache-2.0 per the
  model zoo catalog; the upstream LICENSE was not found in the archive, so verify it:
  https://github.com/PINTO0309/PINTO_model_zoo/tree/main/502_PersonViT
- LVFace-T Glint360K (face recognition), MIT per the model zoo catalog. Check the
  terms of the Glint360K training data before redistributing:
  https://github.com/PINTO0309/PINTO_model_zoo/tree/main/483_LVFace

That model derives from works with their own terms, which may also apply:
- DEIMv2 License (non-commercial purposes only): https://github.com/Intellindust-AI-Lab/DEIMv2/blob/master/LICENSE.md
- DINOv3 License (variants s and x): https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov3/blob/main/LICENSE.md
Review these before redistributing a built image.
